    "long_instructions": "## **Do This:**\r\n\r\n1. Add `paint(\"white\")` before the painter starts moving. Run your code to see what happens.\r\n2. Add a `paint(\"white\")` command after every `move()`. Feel free to try different colors!\r\n3. Add code to continue painting the street east, then turn south to continue painting until the painter reaches the traffic cone.",
